  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.4156494140625,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "forms of disease or those treated with the shorter MDR-TB regimen. The 3762 patients included in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4179077148438,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "the analysis had similar clinical characteristics to the 22 760 individuals excluded, although they were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.5383911132812,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "slightly less likely to be HIV coinfected, have a history of previous treatment or have second-line drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989745140075684,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.5933837890625,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "resistance. Conversely, the rate of failure in those included in the analysis was only 3% compared with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991196632385254,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        265.74761962890625,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "12.7% of those excluded from the analysis.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        148.00790405273438,
        209.15652465820312,
        163.85989379882812
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.0679473876953,
        527.4476928710938,
        185.5109405517578
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation would apply to any longer regimen, regardless of the number of Group A, B",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        184.26783752441406,
        527.3760375976562,
        198.71083068847656
      ],
      "text": "or C agents used and whether an injectable (intensive) phase was used or not. The GDG considered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        197.4678497314453,
        342.9159851074219,
        211.9108428955078
      ],
      "text": "that the findings may apply to other key patient subgroups.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        228.3115997314453,
        328.30096435546875,
        243.97158813476562
      ],
      "text": "Patients aged below 15 years with MDR/RR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.1796417236328,
        527.4561767578125,
        265.6226501464844
      ],
      "text": "Patients aged below 15 years with MDR/RR-TB comprised less than 2% of the IPD meta-analysis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        264.37957763671875,
        527.35107421875,
        278.8226013183594
      ],
      "text": "analysed for PICO question 11 (MDR/RR-TB, 2018). Younger children usually cannot produce",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        277.57958984375,
        527.1661987304688,
        292.0226135253906
      ],
      "text": "sufficient sputum spontaneously to allow a bacteriological diagnosis (many are typically sputum",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        290.77960205078125,
        527.4298706054688,
        305.2226257324219
      ],
      "text": "smear microscopy negative). In these patients, culture may be a more sensitive way to detect viable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.9796142578125,
        527.3761596679688,
        318.4226379394531
      ],
      "text": "TB bacilli even if very few organisms are present in the sputum or other samples that are below the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.17962646484375,
        527.11962890625,
        331.6226501464844
      ],
      "text": "detection threshold of direct microscopy. However, in children who are unable to expectorate, gastric",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995849609375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.3796081542969,
        527.3870849609375,
        344.8226318359375
      ],
      "text": "aspirates or induced sputa may be possible, but the repetition of such tests at monthly frequency",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.5796203613281,
        178.4351043701172,
        358.02264404296875
      ],
      "text": "may not be acceptable.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.4234924316406,
        200.59568786621094,
        390.08349609375
      ],
      "text": "Extrapulmonary disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.2914123535156,
        527.5818481445312,
        411.73443603515625
      ],
      "text": "Extrapulmonary disease is commonly paucibacillary; therefore, biological specimens may contain few",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98529052734375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        410.49139404296875,
        527.389404296875,
        424.9344177246094
      ],
      "text": "or no bacilli. In such situations, detection of persistent disease is more likely with culture, although",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.69140625,
        527.3970336914062,
        438.1344299316406
      ],
      "text": "collection of samples often poses problems. Direct microscopy should still be attempted because it",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.89141845703125,
        300.08746337890625,
        451.3344421386719
      ],
      "text": "may determine positivity much faster than culture.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.73529052734375,
        207.50051879882812,
        483.3952941894531
      ],
      "text": "HIV-negative individuals",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.60321044921875,
        527.3926391601562,
        505.0462341308594
      ],
      "text": "HIV-negative individuals with TB typically have higher bacterial counts in the sputum and a greater",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        503.80322265625,
        527.3131103515625,
        518.2462158203125
      ],
      "text": "likelihood of detection with smear microscopy. In such a situation, it might be expected that the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.003173828125,
        527.5386962890625,
        531.4461669921875
      ],
      "text": "difference in test sensitivity between smear and culture would be less extreme, because fewer patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976675033569336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.2032470703125,
        527.3781127929688,
        544.646240234375
      ],
      "text": "would have subthreshold bacterial counts. However, past studies on datasets from multiple sites in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.4031982421875,
        527.41455078125,
        557.84619140625
      ],
      "text": "which HIV positivity was low reported findings that led to the WHO recommendation, even in 2011,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.6032104492188,
        387.3229675292969,
        571.0462036132812
      ],
      "text": "for joint use of both microscopy and culture, preferably every month.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        587.4470825195312,
        292.64288330078125,
        603.1071166992188
      ],
      "text": "Patients on the shorter MDR-TB regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.3151245117188,
        527.4069213867188,
        624.7581176757812
      ],
      "text": "Patients on the shorter MDR-TB regimen have a much shorter duration of intensive phase and total",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        623.5150146484375,
        527.4069213867188,
        637.9580078125
      ],
      "text": "treatment. They receive seven drugs in the initial phase and, if fully compliant with the inclusion and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.7150268554688,
        527.4288940429688,
        651.1580200195312
      ],
      "text": "exclusion criteria, usually have a more favourable prognostic outlook than other MDR-TB patients.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        649.9150390625,
        527.385009765625,
        664.3580322265625
      ],
      "text": "Programmes may thus consider that patients on a shorter MDR-TB regimen may need less frequent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.114990234375,
        527.4134521484375,
        677.5579833984375
      ],
      "text": "or no culture to monitor treatment. Although the current analysis did not include patients treated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.3151245117188,
        527.421142578125,
        690.7581176757812
      ],
      "text": "with shorter regimens, the GDG proposes that programmes that implement this regimen should aim",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.5150146484375,
        527.4345092773438,
        703.9580078125
      ],
      "text": "for more frequent culture testing, especially after the intensive phase, to confirm bacteriological cure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        702.7150268554688,
        527.4279174804688,
        717.1580200195312
      ],
      "text": "in patients who complete treatment without signs of failure. Any sign of recurrence after termination",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.9150390625,
        484.9700622558594,
        730.3580322265625
      ],
      "text": "of treatment should also be investigated using sputum smear microscopy, culture and DST.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.099609375,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2 Drug-resistant TB treatment: Recommendations  149",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}